(5399685, 776392, 63633, '<td valign="top">This has a real njsabs2323 feel to it. I was going to do something similar for this challenge, but I didn''t have a model of the right age (My 1 year old was a bit young). My attempt would never have had the brilliance that this one achieves though. Beautifully, beautifully lit, and I really love the composition too. My only irk is the fact that the soap is a little off-centre, but it also kind of adds to the charm. My pick for the blue.</td>', 'This has a real njsabs2323 feel to it. I was going to do something similar for this challenge, but I didn''t have a model of the right age (My 1 year old was a bit young). My attempt would never have had the brilliance that this one achieves though. Beautifully, beautifully lit, and I really love the composition too. My only irk is the fact that the soap is a little off-centre, but it also kind of adds to the charm. My pick for the blue.', '2009-03-25 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
