(5401060, 776355, 96881, '<td valign="top">Inspiring person..............<br/> <br/>Not really sure on your cropping of this photo.  It feels really constrained at the top.  I feel it needed more room above his headm and to the left as well.......</td>', 'Inspiring person.............. Not really sure on your cropping of this photo.  It feels really constrained at the top.  I feel it needed more room above his headm and to the left as well.......', '2009-03-25 21:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401062, 775548, 96881, '<td valign="top">Different take ont eh challenge topic.  Not sure that the image is strong enough at showing it though.  This photo could have been composed in a significantly more dramitic way to really sell the story.</td>', 'Different take ont eh challenge topic.  Not sure that the image is strong enough at showing it though.  This photo could have been composed in a significantly more dramitic way to really sell the story.', '2009-03-25 21:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401063, 774539, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of him being off-centre, however I feel it would have worked better if the space was on the right side of the phoo, instead of the left, as he is facing right........</td>', 'I like the idea of him being off-centre, however I feel it would have worked better if the space was on the right side of the phoo, instead of the left, as he is facing right........', '2009-03-25 21:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401065, 775604, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice take on a different way to communicate.  Prehaps some extra room at the top of the image, thus moving the flag onto the third line, and the cars onto the upper third line could have made this even better</td>', 'Nice take on a different way to communicate.  Prehaps some extra room at the top of the image, thus moving the flag onto the third line, and the cars onto the upper third line could have made this even better', '2009-03-25 21:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401070, 775894, 96881, '<td valign="top">Is there a reaason the T is so far off aligned.  Everytime I look at this image, that is what draws my attention.  The U is the only other letter that is not lined up...........<br/> <br/>The border works to frame this well, the highlights on the keys do work for the most part</td>', 'Is there a reaason the T is so far off aligned.  Everytime I look at this image, that is what draws my attention.  The U is the only other letter that is not lined up........... The border works to frame this well, the highlights on the keys do work for the most part', '2009-03-25 21:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401076, 776303, 96881, '<td valign="top">hmmmmmm, you have taken a photo and turned it into a political statement..............I will now ignore the title<br/> <br/>The light is a problem.  The gradiant of light means the F is quite dark, and all attention is drawn to the E at the end.  Having more space int eh photo may have helped draw attention to the word, rather than to the individial letters.  To me it also appears to read backwards.  With the E being both larger and brighter, I seem to read right to left, EERF instead.  With the light like this, maybe shooting fromt eh other end, having the F larger (but darker) may have then emphasised the word, instead of all attention going to the letter E</td>', 'hmmmmmm, you have taken a photo and turned it into a political statement..............I will now ignore the title The light is a problem.  The gradiant of light means the F is quite dark, and all attention is drawn to the E at the end.  Having more space int eh photo may have helped draw attention to the word, rather than to the individial letters.  To me it also appears to read backwards.  With the E being both larger and brighter, I seem to read right to left, EERF instead.  With the light like this, maybe shooting fromt eh other end, having the F larger (but darker) may have then emphasised the word, instead of all attention going to the letter E', '2009-03-25 21:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401079, 775788, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this.  It doesn''t follow the exat norms, things are cropped off, but it works for me.  The dark, broading of a young kid playing the blues, picking through the music.  I think it needed to be dark like it is, others might disagree, but I like it......</td>', 'I like the composition of this.  It doesn''t follow the exat norms, things are cropped off, but it works for me.  The dark, broading of a young kid playing the blues, picking through the music.  I think it needed to be dark like it is, others might disagree, but I like it......', '2009-03-25 21:20:49.000000', NULL, 1);
