(5401081, 776220, 96881, '<td valign="top">A different coloured shirt, so that the hand does not merge into it may have been better, and I can see noise in the shirt as well, which detracts from the really good composition</td>', 'A different coloured shirt, so that the hand does not merge into it may have been better, and I can see noise in the shirt as well, which detracts from the really good composition', '2009-03-25 21:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401084, 776025, 96881, '<td valign="top">Would have loved to see the expression on the kid, with the dirt smeared al over his face, rather than it being cropped off.  I think you lost half the message of the photo with this crop.  Also, i don''t think the border is adding anything to this shot</td>', 'Would have loved to see the expression on the kid, with the dirt smeared al over his face, rather than it being cropped off.  I think you lost half the message of the photo with this crop.  Also, i don''t think the border is adding anything to this shot', '2009-03-25 21:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
