(5401341, 774850, 96881, '<td valign="top">Is post a language? Even a letter is not really Language, but I will allow it anyway, as I see a strong connection to communication, and the use of language<br/> <br/>I presume you in Processing went for the blown out sky, especially seeing the effect that this processing had on the tree. The stark look is one that can work effectively, but the loss of detail on the tree etc I think hurts it here..  The range of shades through the photo is good (ignoring the sky) with everything from black through white present.</td>', 'Is post a language? Even a letter is not really Language, but I will allow it anyway, as I see a strong connection to communication, and the use of language I presume you in Processing went for the blown out sky, especially seeing the effect that this processing had on the tree. The stark look is one that can work effectively, but the loss of detail on the tree etc I think hurts it here..  The range of shades through the photo is good (ignoring the sky) with everything from black through white present.', '2009-03-25 23:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401343, 776240, 96881, '<td valign="top">Blurry, yes.  Good effect however.  I like the curvature that results in the code.  I like the idea you had as well.</td>', 'Blurry, yes.  Good effect however.  I like the curvature that results in the code.  I like the idea you had as well.', '2009-03-25 23:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401347, 776335, 96881, '<td valign="top">An undertsnading, maybe.  Language, a bit of a stretch though.<br/>The minimalist ground can work on occassion, I just don''t think it has here though.  it results in feet cut off, and the interest of the photo being in the very bottom of the shot, which I don''t think works</td>', 'An undertsnading, maybe.  Language, a bit of a stretch though.The minimalist ground can work on occassion, I just don''t think it has here though.  it results in feet cut off, and the interest of the photo being in the very bottom of the shot, which I don''t think works', '2009-03-25 23:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401353, 776191, 96881, '<td valign="top">Have seen this done before, and the effect here, while good, is not outstanding.  The red is a nice touch for this, but the uneveness doesn''t help.  Also not sure this book is the best.  I would like to see the cover cropped out, and a book where the pages sit a bit flatter to make the effect work better</td>', 'Have seen this done before, and the effect here, while good, is not outstanding.  The red is a nice touch for this, but the uneveness doesn''t help.  Also not sure this book is the best.  I would like to see the cover cropped out, and a book where the pages sit a bit flatter to make the effect work better', '2009-03-25 23:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
