(5401719, 776304, 78062, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the work you put in to make the sign and set up the props etc but the pic doesn''t really have anything in there to hold my attention. I usually comment and try and think of ways to make it better but i''m not sure I can here... I just don''t have a clue.</td>', 'I appreciate the work you put in to make the sign and set up the props etc but the pic doesn''t really have anything in there to hold my attention. I usually comment and try and think of ways to make it better but i''m not sure I can here... I just don''t have a clue.', '2009-03-26 06:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401723, 775598, 78062, '<td valign="top">Ok... the only reason the water drop is in there is to show off the whole ''picture in waterdrop'' thing that''s been done a billion times already. Usually it adds to the picture or is there for a purpose, but here it seems like a cheap attempt to score points from newbies who haven''t seen it before.<br/> <br/>The picture is technically accomplished, but going for the cheap vote with the water drop is something I find quite disappointing and bordering on the insulting.<br/> <br/>Like I said, the picture is nice. It''s actually nice enough without going for the water drop. All it needs is a purple sunset put on a computer screen behind a wine glass filled with water and you''ve summed up DPC''s cheesiness.</td>', 'Ok... the only reason the water drop is in there is to show off the whole ''picture in waterdrop'' thing that''s been done a billion times already. Usually it adds to the picture or is there for a purpose, but here it seems like a cheap attempt to score points from newbies who haven''t seen it before. The picture is technically accomplished, but going for the cheap vote with the water drop is something I find quite disappointing and bordering on the insulting. Like I said, the picture is nice. It''s actually nice enough without going for the water drop. All it needs is a purple sunset put on a computer screen behind a wine glass filled with water and you''ve summed up DPC''s cheesiness.', '2009-03-26 06:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401724, 775905, 78062, '<td valign="top">the pic would have probably worked better if the focus was on the book and not on the kid. The kid in this picture is irrelevant, the homework is the subject and would have conveyed a clearer message.</td>', 'the pic would have probably worked better if the focus was on the book and not on the kid. The kid in this picture is irrelevant, the homework is the subject and would have conveyed a clearer message.', '2009-03-26 06:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
