(5401727, 775578, 78062, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame the main thing in focus is the guy''s finger.<br/> <br/>Nice calcium deposit on his nail though. He should drink more milk.</td>', 'It''s a shame the main thing in focus is the guy''s finger. Nice calcium deposit on his nail though. He should drink more milk.', '2009-03-26 06:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
