(5401742, 776204, 78062, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how I feel about this, I can''t decide if it''s subtely racist or not. DO they have bongos in Egypt and Morocco and Libya? I''m not entirely sure they do and I think you''ve over-generalised a LOT here that makes it kind of offensive.</td>', 'I''m not sure how I feel about this, I can''t decide if it''s subtely racist or not. DO they have bongos in Egypt and Morocco and Libya? I''m not entirely sure they do and I think you''ve over-generalised a LOT here that makes it kind of offensive.', '2009-03-26 06:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
