(5401744, 775887, 78062, '<td valign="top">He writes loans? Does he work in a bank or something? Maybe he''s protesting against the banks for screwing up the economy so he spraypaints it.<br/> <br/>Oh wait, you meant ''lone''...<br/> <br/>That''s even funnier.</td>', 'He writes loans? Does he work in a bank or something? Maybe he''s protesting against the banks for screwing up the economy so he spraypaints it. Oh wait, you meant ''lone''... That''s even funnier.', '2009-03-26 06:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
