(5402093, 775887, 98141, '<td valign="top">The language of art and grafitti, a language that I enjoy quite a bit if done in the right places by the right people. This image technically falls a little flat for me, but I''ve never minded that so much with grafitti pics because it makes the shot feel like a frame from a comic.</td>', 'The language of art and grafitti, a language that I enjoy quite a bit if done in the right places by the right people. This image technically falls a little flat for me, but I''ve never minded that so much with grafitti pics because it makes the shot feel like a frame from a comic.', '2009-03-26 13:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402095, 775548, 99981, '<td valign="top">DNMC for me, the title doesn''t convice me too and i don''t see it described in this shot! Sorry if i was rude, good luck to you!</td>', 'DNMC for me, the title doesn''t convice me too and i don''t see it described in this shot! Sorry if i was rude, good luck to you!', '2009-03-26 13:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402097, 775802, 98141, '<td valign="top">Primitive language, I think this is a great visual representation for this challenge. Technically, I think the image is alittle grainy and would do well in black and white.</td>', 'Primitive language, I think this is a great visual representation for this challenge. Technically, I think the image is alittle grainy and would do well in black and white.', '2009-03-26 13:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402101, 775804, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ah, the secret language of little boys... This is something I''ve never been privy to, but great moment to capture for the challenge. Their expressions are perfect, mischievious, intriguing.</td>', 'Ah, the secret language of little boys... This is something I''ve never been privy to, but great moment to capture for the challenge. Their expressions are perfect, mischievious, intriguing.', '2009-03-26 13:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402102, 775888, 98141, '<td valign="top">This, I think, is from a school play? The image loaded a little small. Language of love, the body language of the woman is what I noticed first: I think perhaps her character is not particularly excited about this engagement.</td>', 'This, I think, is from a school play? The image loaded a little small. Language of love, the body language of the woman is what I noticed first: I think perhaps her character is not particularly excited about this engagement.', '2009-03-26 13:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402106, 776087, 98141, '<td valign="top">The language of music. I find the brown bottom right corner to be a bit distracting, I think this would not be a problem for me in black and white.</td>', 'The language of music. I find the brown bottom right corner to be a bit distracting, I think this would not be a problem for me in black and white.', '2009-03-26 13:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402110, 776304, 33909, '<td valign="top">ha... original idea... the dog is like "I don''t care" :-)</td>', 'ha... original idea... the dog is like "I don''t care" :-)', '2009-03-26 13:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402112, 775440, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition, I like that you rotated the pic. Great DOF, the language of music is certainly applies to this challenge, great in black and white as well.</td>', 'Very interesting composition, I like that you rotated the pic. Great DOF, the language of music is certainly applies to this challenge, great in black and white as well.', '2009-03-26 13:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402113, 776151, 99981, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get this border, i think it''s a little dark and there is a really distracting light on the left. I like the idea, but it''s not appearing that much! Sorry if i was rude to you, good luck!</td>', 'I didn''t get this border, i think it''s a little dark and there is a really distracting light on the left. I like the idea, but it''s not appearing that much! Sorry if i was rude to you, good luck!', '2009-03-26 13:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402114, 775889, 811, '<td valign="top">ewwwwwwwwwwww</td>', 'ewwwwwwwwwwww', '2009-03-26 13:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402116, 776087, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but to represent language i would like to see some action in it. It''s a DMNC for me. Sorry if i was rude.</td>', 'I like the shot but to represent language i would like to see some action in it. It''s a DMNC for me. Sorry if i was rude.', '2009-03-26 13:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402118, 776366, 99981, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and good catch! Represents language in a really beautiful way!</td>', 'Nice portrait and good catch! Represents language in a really beautiful way!', '2009-03-26 13:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402120, 776147, 99981, '<td valign="top">I miss portuguese there, but it''s alright, hehe. nice shot! I just don''t like the reflections at the table.</td>', 'I miss portuguese there, but it''s alright, hehe. nice shot! I just don''t like the reflections at the table.', '2009-03-26 13:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402150, 776355, 88247, '<td valign="top">I have felt such great emotion from this shot:-(<br/>It makes you realise just how lucky most of us are!! <br/>It also makes you stop and think about those that are not as fortunate as ourselves,and how they manage to get on with their lives from day to day.<br/>This sure is a shot about language that we can all learn from:-)</td>', 'I have felt such great emotion from this shot:-(It makes you realise just how lucky most of us are!! It also makes you stop and think about those that are not as fortunate as ourselves,and how they manage to get on with their lives from day to day.This sure is a shot about language that we can all learn from:-)', '2009-03-26 13:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402175, 775779, 63499, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier, just coming back to comment. I immediately hear/think the word stop when I look at this. However, I wish either all of the guy or at least his hand was in focus. The hand, to me, is what is saying the word the stop. Personally, I feel the whistle is more of a sound/noise than actual language. 6</td>', 'Voted earlier, just coming back to comment. I immediately hear/think the word stop when I look at this. However, I wish either all of the guy or at least his hand was in focus. The hand, to me, is what is saying the word the stop. Personally, I feel the whistle is more of a sound/noise than actual language. 6', '2009-03-26 14:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402176, 775070, 63499, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier, just coming back to comment. Not sure if this really says language to me, but I like it and it made me laugh. Bumping it up an 8.</td>', 'Voted earlier, just coming back to comment. Not sure if this really says language to me, but I like it and it made me laugh. Bumping it up an 8.', '2009-03-26 14:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402180, 776191, 63499, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier, just coming back to comment. I like that it contains a book, but in a different way than others I''ve seen. I also like that you are using it to promote another language idea.</td>', 'Voted earlier, just coming back to comment. I like that it contains a book, but in a different way than others I''ve seen. I also like that you are using it to promote another language idea.', '2009-03-26 14:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402209, 776238, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nice shot!</td>', 'Great idea and nice shot!', '2009-03-26 14:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402210, 775891, 99981, '<td valign="top"><strike>This shot is really amazing and anguishing! I''m sorry but i just don''t think it meets the challenge so much. I look at the photo and i don''t see comunication or language. I see it representing anguishing and suffer.</strike> <br/> <br/>Everyone should take a look at the definition of language before voting...I think i was too tough at my vote and comment, i really like this shot, and that''s why i felt i couldn''t vote on it without seing the concept of language again. By the concept here in my contry, one of the definitions of language is everything that comunicates or represents a feeling. Hope you do well, i''m changing my vote.</td>', 'This shot is really amazing and anguishing! I''m sorry but i just don''t think it meets the challenge so much. I look at the photo and i don''t see comunication or language. I see it representing anguishing and suffer.  Everyone should take a look at the definition of language before voting...I think i was too tough at my vote and comment, i really like this shot, and that''s why i felt i couldn''t vote on it without seing the concept of language again. By the concept here in my contry, one of the definitions of language is everything that comunicates or represents a feeling. Hope you do well, i''m changing my vote.', '2009-03-26 14:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402228, 776304, 63499, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier, just coming back to comment. I like this idea! The lighting looks a little harsh on the dog and I wish the table cloth was flat. I do like how the dog has that "guilty kid" look - he knows that he can''t get out of it, but he''s going to keep arguing until there are no more options left.</td>', 'Voted earlier, just coming back to comment. I like this idea! The lighting looks a little harsh on the dog and I wish the table cloth was flat. I do like how the dog has that "guilty kid" look - he knows that he can''t get out of it, but he''s going to keep arguing until there are no more options left.', '2009-03-26 14:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402386, 776260, 104230, '<td valign="top">Yup, music is one of the great universal languages, that''s for sure.  Nice composition.  I particularly like the reflections of the musical score on the instrument, and the off white you achieved for the paper, or perhaps it was that color anyway.  An aside (and this did not influence my scoring in any way..) I suspect the score used in this image was not one for this woodwind instrument... it looks more like something written for the piano!</td>', 'Yup, music is one of the great universal languages, that''s for sure.  Nice composition.  I particularly like the reflections of the musical score on the instrument, and the off white you achieved for the paper, or perhaps it was that color anyway.  An aside (and this did not influence my scoring in any way..) I suspect the score used in this image was not one for this woodwind instrument... it looks more like something written for the piano!', '2009-03-26 16:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402399, 776376, 104230, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, although I find the person in the seats above the two players and his white shirt and sock rather distracting. Cropping much closer to the players in general might have been effective.</td>', 'Interesting idea, although I find the person in the seats above the two players and his white shirt and sock rather distracting. Cropping much closer to the players in general might have been effective.', '2009-03-26 16:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
