(5402746, 775284, 45475, '<td valign="top">I understand what you were going for in relation to the challenge, and that''s fine, but I just can''t do snot. I can, only just barely, handle specks of dirt or food on faces. But why on earth are you showing me this child''s mucous? Were there no tissues handy? Would the boy have stopped crying if you wiped his nose? Sorry, I just don''t know what else to say...<br/> <br/>***<br/> <br/><i>Post challenge edit</i>: Because you shouldn''t make assumptions... I was already a parent while you were still looking up girl''s skirts in the school yard.<br/> <br/>Meet my son Max, almost 10 <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=663043" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/827/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_663043.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/827/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_663043.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/827/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_663043.jpg"/></a> <br/>and my daughter Ally, 18 yrs <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=511014" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/680/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_511014.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/680/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_511014.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/680/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_511014.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-01 05:23:41.</i></td>', 'I understand what you were going for in relation to the challenge, and that''s fine, but I just can''t do snot. I can, only just barely, handle specks of dirt or food on faces. But why on earth are you showing me this child''s mucous? Were there no tissues handy? Would the boy have stopped crying if you wiped his nose? Sorry, I just don''t know what else to say... *** Post challenge edit: Because you shouldn''t make assumptions... I was already a parent while you were still looking up girl''s skirts in the school yard. Meet my son Max, almost 10  and my daughter Ally, 18 yrs ', '2009-03-26 19:07:11.000000', '2009-04-01 06:23:41.000000', 1),
(5402747, 775890, 63499, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this. However, this looks very soft, as in out of focus soft. Also, she looks like she''s into the moment, but he doesn''t.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this. However, this looks very soft, as in out of focus soft. Also, she looks like she''s into the moment, but he doesn''t.', '2009-03-26 19:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402753, 775829, 63499, '<td valign="top">Awww...what a cute puppy! I like how she looks like she''s sorry, however, the flash caused her eyes to look weird and is a little harsh.</td>', 'Awww...what a cute puppy! I like how she looks like she''s sorry, however, the flash caused her eyes to look weird and is a little harsh.', '2009-03-26 19:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402763, 776399, 45475, '<td valign="top">Ok, it''s a little cheeky, but meets the challenge. What lets it down heavily though, is the snap shot feel to it. The glare from the flash on the door is severe. The door itself was probably a bad choice for background anyway. Then you''ve chopped off her feet.... and wrapped the image up in a fuchsia border.<br/> <br/>How to minimise the glare from flash, would be to diffuse it. Tape a bit of tissue over the flash next time and try that. Or better yet, go outside! I can''t help thinking this set up would have been awesome had she been posing outside a school...</td>', 'Ok, it''s a little cheeky, but meets the challenge. What lets it down heavily though, is the snap shot feel to it. The glare from the flash on the door is severe. The door itself was probably a bad choice for background anyway. Then you''ve chopped off her feet.... and wrapped the image up in a fuchsia border. How to minimise the glare from flash, would be to diffuse it. Tape a bit of tissue over the flash next time and try that. Or better yet, go outside! I can''t help thinking this set up would have been awesome had she been posing outside a school...', '2009-03-26 19:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402774, 775359, 45475, '<td valign="top">Yes it is. But is this a good photograph of it? No. The light is dull and murky and the angle/point of view is uncomfortable. At the end of the day, you''ve haphazardly snapped off a shot of someone else''s work, devoid of any real interaction by you the photographer.</td>', 'Yes it is. But is this a good photograph of it? No. The light is dull and murky and the angle/point of view is uncomfortable. At the end of the day, you''ve haphazardly snapped off a shot of someone else''s work, devoid of any real interaction by you the photographer.', '2009-03-26 19:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402895, 776281, 96881, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm, a photo of a bird.  Not really saying Language to me, even with your title.....Sorry<br/> <br/>Apart from that, it is a good photo, just not really to my liking.  Its sharp, its well exposed.  Has both true black and white elements.  The water is a bit distracting thought.....</td>', 'Hmmmmm, a photo of a bird.  Not really saying Language to me, even with your title.....Sorry Apart from that, it is a good photo, just not really to my liking.  Its sharp, its well exposed.  Has both true black and white elements.  The water is a bit distracting thought.....', '2009-03-26 20:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402905, 776216, 96881, '<td valign="top">A number of people have gone this way.  The dirty fingers distract.  Part oif the hand is overexposed.  The crop makes the photo feel incomplete.  However the depth of field for this was spot on.....</td>', 'A number of people have gone this way.  The dirty fingers distract.  Part oif the hand is overexposed.  The crop makes the photo feel incomplete.  However the depth of field for this was spot on.....', '2009-03-26 20:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402908, 775578, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great photo for this challenge.  Well composed, basic elements that all work.  Great focus and colours.  A really good submission.....</td>', 'A great photo for this challenge.  Well composed, basic elements that all work.  Great focus and colours.  A really good submission.....', '2009-03-26 20:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402911, 776315, 96881, '<td valign="top">The angle of this is awkward.  I find myself tilting my head to read what is on the screen, and the message really does not make a heap on sense in the scheme of the photo.  The colours seem quite a bit off here as well......</td>', 'The angle of this is awkward.  I find myself tilting my head to read what is on the screen, and the message really does not make a heap on sense in the scheme of the photo.  The colours seem quite a bit off here as well......', '2009-03-26 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402918, 774590, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice composition here.  I like the guitar bordering the photo on the side.  I dio need a trasnlator to read that music.  Makes no sense to me.  Maybe a slightly ricgher colour could have been acheived in the guitar head to add a little more to the photo, but that is being picky.  Good Photo, well done</td>', 'Nice composition here.  I like the guitar bordering the photo on the side.  I dio need a trasnlator to read that music.  Makes no sense to me.  Maybe a slightly ricgher colour could have been acheived in the guitar head to add a little more to the photo, but that is being picky.  Good Photo, well done', '2009-03-26 20:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402922, 775284, 96881, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this photo does not appeal to me. The lighting is harsh, the expression isn''t appealing, and the running nose just doesn''t work for me</td>', 'Sorry, this photo does not appeal to me. The lighting is harsh, the expression isn''t appealing, and the running nose just doesn''t work for me', '2009-03-26 20:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402955, 775779, 96881, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Maybe this would have been better in colour, as I feel his head and hand don''t jump out of the photo enough.  There is a lot of grey here, so that the skin tone grey merges with the background a little too much.<br/> <br/>Other than that, a well composed image for the challenge</td>', 'Good idea.  Maybe this would have been better in colour, as I feel his head and hand don''t jump out of the photo enough.  There is a lot of grey here, so that the skin tone grey merges with the background a little too much. Other than that, a well composed image for the challenge', '2009-03-26 20:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402956, 776241, 96881, '<td valign="top">hmmmm, doesn''t really say language to me, even with the title, it is a photo of a cat.  Just my opinion........<br/> <br/>The border does nothing for me with this either.  The overall phoot is reasonably well lit, but just doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'hmmmm, doesn''t really say language to me, even with the title, it is a photo of a cat.  Just my opinion........ The border does nothing for me with this either.  The overall phoot is reasonably well lit, but just doesn''t appeal to me.', '2009-03-26 20:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402960, 775440, 96881, '<td valign="top">Don''t understand why you gave that title.  Writing Musioc Connects People I feel makes a better connection with the photo.<br/> <br/>Interestiong use of depth of field.  it does make the pen really stand out as the subject.  However it also emphasises the very centred composition.  Having the pen on the forward third may have worked a little better, with the foreground music in more focus, and the background fading out......</td>', 'Don''t understand why you gave that title.  Writing Musioc Connects People I feel makes a better connection with the photo. Interestiong use of depth of field.  it does make the pen really stand out as the subject.  However it also emphasises the very centred composition.  Having the pen on the forward third may have worked a little better, with the foreground music in more focus, and the background fading out......', '2009-03-26 20:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
