(5403320, 775889, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this.  The result was never going to be visually appealing though.  Not sure about cropping off the chin either.........</td>', 'I like the idea of this.  The result was never going to be visually appealing though.  Not sure about cropping off the chin either.........', '2009-03-27 00:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403760, 776026, 84438, '<td valign="top">No vote.  GO SNOWMEN!</td>', 'No vote.  GO SNOWMEN!', '2009-03-27 09:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403767, 774799, 84438, '<td valign="top">Hello fellow geek!  Unfortunately the crop of this photo makes it quite small.  A good concept, but the composition doesn''t add a lot of interest.  It might have looked better if a selection of books were taken off of the shelves, and arranged in a pleasing way.  Same concept, just more visual interest.</td>', 'Hello fellow geek!  Unfortunately the crop of this photo makes it quite small.  A good concept, but the composition doesn''t add a lot of interest.  It might have looked better if a selection of books were taken off of the shelves, and arranged in a pleasing way.  Same concept, just more visual interest.', '2009-03-27 09:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403769, 775887, 84438, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing.  My eye doesn''t know where to land on this photo..   I think the processing does add visual interest to this photo, so it seems to work.</td>', 'Interesting processing.  My eye doesn''t know where to land on this photo..   I think the processing does add visual interest to this photo, so it seems to work.', '2009-03-27 10:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403770, 775115, 84438, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting.', '2009-03-27 10:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403771, 775585, 84438, '<td valign="top">Contrast is low between the brick wall and the subject, which causes your subject to kind of blend in to the photo.  Depending on what colours she was wearing, you might have been able to isolate those colours and increased the luminence, thereby giving more contrast...  And that would be legal in basic.</td>', 'Contrast is low between the brick wall and the subject, which causes your subject to kind of blend in to the photo.  Depending on what colours she was wearing, you might have been able to isolate those colours and increased the luminence, thereby giving more contrast...  And that would be legal in basic.', '2009-03-27 10:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403772, 775320, 84438, '<td valign="top">Simple, effective composition.</td>', 'Simple, effective composition.', '2009-03-27 10:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403773, 776315, 84438, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately a bit dark, because this is a great concept.</td>', 'Unfortunately a bit dark, because this is a great concept.', '2009-03-27 10:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
