(5404503, 776264, 105164, '<td valign="top">I like the composure and the lighting of the picture, but something about the "graininess" really takes alot away, as well as the bright spot on the tip of the right hand.</td>', 'I like the composure and the lighting of the picture, but something about the "graininess" really takes alot away, as well as the bright spot on the tip of the right hand.', '2009-03-27 21:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
