(5404904, 776337, 96614, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but there is some odd processing, or quality issues going on, look at her neck,,, there are stripes of different shades of pink...</td>', 'Great idea, but there is some odd processing, or quality issues going on, look at her neck,,, there are stripes of different shades of pink...', '2009-03-28 08:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
