(5404931, 776240, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!!! This type of shot is very tricky... My pic is the other one with binary code behind a drip coming out of a blue internet cable.  <br/> <br/>I also took a pic called "Binary Leak" for the numbers challenge a couple months back.  If you go to that pic, you can see some setup pics,<br/> <br/>also, I will add setup pics to my current pic as well.  My shot took about 4 hours to take and about 350 pictures to get the drip just the way I wanted it...<br/> <br/> <br/>Great job on remembering to flip the image behind the drip upside down  =)</td>', 'Nice shot!!! This type of shot is very tricky... My pic is the other one with binary code behind a drip coming out of a blue internet cable.   I also took a pic called "Binary Leak" for the numbers challenge a couple months back.  If you go to that pic, you can see some setup pics, also, I will add setup pics to my current pic as well.  My shot took about 4 hours to take and about 350 pictures to get the drip just the way I wanted it...  Great job on remembering to flip the image behind the drip upside down  =)', '2009-03-28 08:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404933, 776234, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF!!!</td>', 'Nice DOF!!!', '2009-03-28 08:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404935, 776026, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice!!!   Irene?  hahaha jokes!<br/> <br/>Go Snowmen!!!</td>', 'Nice!!!   Irene?  hahaha jokes! Go Snowmen!!!', '2009-03-28 08:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404976, 776375, 43774, '<td valign="top">A good idea but it looks a little flat and the harsh shadow isn''t helping.</td>', 'A good idea but it looks a little flat and the harsh shadow isn''t helping.', '2009-03-28 09:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405011, 776238, 81362, '<td valign="top">Creative approach the the topic, and nice muted colors. Having the bottle horizontal lends a static feeling to the composition. I wonder if it would have been more visually interesting with the bottle positioned somewhat diagonally.</td>', 'Creative approach the the topic, and nice muted colors. Having the bottle horizontal lends a static feeling to the composition. I wonder if it would have been more visually interesting with the bottle positioned somewhat diagonally.', '2009-03-28 09:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405013, 774902, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good use of light, and interesting character study. Facial expressions are, indeed, a language recognizable all over the world.</td>', 'Good use of light, and interesting character study. Facial expressions are, indeed, a language recognizable all over the world.', '2009-03-28 09:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405022, 774879, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lot of work to produce such nice lettering. Wish the image could be a bit brighter.</td>', 'Looks like a lot of work to produce such nice lettering. Wish the image could be a bit brighter.', '2009-03-28 09:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405029, 776399, 81362, '<td valign="top">Gesture would be recognized in many countries, but the rather gentle expression seems to be a mismatch. The bright reflection on the door paint lowers the image quality, and might be reduced using a diffuser or an off-camera flash.</td>', 'Gesture would be recognized in many countries, but the rather gentle expression seems to be a mismatch. The bright reflection on the door paint lowers the image quality, and might be reduced using a diffuser or an off-camera flash.', '2009-03-28 09:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405042, 775788, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good dynamic positioning, enjoyable gradation of light across the face. Although the leg makes a leading line toward the subject, the strong contrast of leg against dark guitar holds my eye away from the main elements. In advanced editing, selective adjustment might help. In basic, long pants might be a workable alternative.</td>', 'Good dynamic positioning, enjoyable gradation of light across the face. Although the leg makes a leading line toward the subject, the strong contrast of leg against dark guitar holds my eye away from the main elements. In advanced editing, selective adjustment might help. In basic, long pants might be a workable alternative.', '2009-03-28 09:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405230, 776229, 91975, '<td valign="top">cliche :(</td>', 'cliche :(', '2009-03-28 13:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405799, 775597, 21253, '<td valign="top">Great book and great picture.</td>', 'Great book and great picture.', '2009-03-28 20:47:39.000000', NULL, 1);
