(5406569, 774902, 52549, '<td valign="top">I love this, it''s a beautiful portrait and he has a wonderful face. Good luck.</td>', 'I love this, it''s a beautiful portrait and he has a wonderful face. Good luck.', '2009-03-29 14:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
