(5406679, 776229, 102562, '<td valign="top">This says it all. Perfect :)</td>', 'This says it all. Perfect :)', '2009-03-29 17:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5406698, 775829, 62249, '<td valign="top">Cute dog. Flash lighting is a little harsh.</td>', 'Cute dog. Flash lighting is a little harsh.', '2009-03-29 17:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5406700, 776366, 62249, '<td valign="top">Looks like the child is saying "Feed me more dirt, please."  Cute capture.</td>', 'Looks like the child is saying "Feed me more dirt, please."  Cute capture.', '2009-03-29 17:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5406706, 775359, 62249, '<td valign="top">The hieroglyphs are interesting, but you haven''t done anything particularly interpretive in the photo. It''s just a flat shot of someone else''s work (or possibly yours if you were the artist ;-).</td>', 'The hieroglyphs are interesting, but you haven''t done anything particularly interpretive in the photo. It''s just a flat shot of someone else''s work (or possibly yours if you were the artist ;-).', '2009-03-29 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5406709, 776209, 62249, '<td valign="top">Really nice, sharp focus on the dog''s eye.</td>', 'Really nice, sharp focus on the dog''s eye.', '2009-03-29 17:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5406723, 774850, 62249, '<td valign="top">The processing is a little odd. It leaves one of the tree branches looking disembodies, with both ends just floating in space (above the rightmost mailbox). And the leftmost mailbox has an odd blur to it. Still, the concept isn''t bad.</td>', 'The processing is a little odd. It leaves one of the tree branches looking disembodies, with both ends just floating in space (above the rightmost mailbox). And the leftmost mailbox has an odd blur to it. Still, the concept isn''t bad.', '2009-03-29 17:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5406730, 775779, 62249, '<td valign="top">Great title. Like the blurred background, but would prefer a little more DOF to get the hand sharper, in addition to his already sharp face.</td>', 'Great title. Like the blurred background, but would prefer a little more DOF to get the hand sharper, in addition to his already sharp face.', '2009-03-29 17:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5406735, 775284, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very emotive, but the ceiling fan growing out of the side of the child''s head is distracting.</td>', 'Very emotive, but the ceiling fan growing out of the side of the child''s head is distracting.', '2009-03-29 17:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5406738, 775887, 86447, '<td valign="top">He writes loans???  LOL!    Looks like he''s a lone writer.   But, this is a good image for "Language".</td>', 'He writes loans???  LOL!    Looks like he''s a lone writer.   But, this is a good image for "Language".', '2009-03-29 17:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5406739, 776232, 86447, '<td valign="top">When you have more than one of something, you just add an ''s'' to the word.   Basics<br/> <br/>If something belongs to something/someone (possession), then you add an apostrophe and an ''s''.   Basic''s<br/> <br/>There''s your grammar lesson for the day.   :)   <br/> <br/>Since this is a photography challenge, not a grammar challenge:<br/> <br/>This is well shot.   I like the composition... most would have the stack toward the left side but this creates a bit of ''tension'' that works here.   <br/>I don''t like the border.  But, this isn''t a border challenge, either.  *grin*</td>', 'When you have more than one of something, you just add an ''s'' to the word.   Basics If something belongs to something/someone (possession), then you add an apostrophe and an ''s''.   Basic''s There''s your grammar lesson for the day.   :)    Since this is a photography challenge, not a grammar challenge: This is well shot.   I like the composition... most would have the stack toward the left side but this creates a bit of ''tension'' that works here.   I don''t like the border.  But, this isn''t a border challenge, either.  *grin*', '2009-03-29 17:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
