(5409230, 776376, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  I would probably have cropped off on the left to get rid of the cut off names, and below to get rid of the cut off score.  To balance this, also would have removed a little off the left, so that they were not too centred.  Would have resulted in a square photo, but that might have worked.  The cut off areas, especially as they are bright, draw attention away from the players</td>', 'I like the idea.  I would probably have cropped off on the left to get rid of the cut off names, and below to get rid of the cut off score.  To balance this, also would have removed a little off the left, so that they were not too centred.  Would have resulted in a square photo, but that might have worked.  The cut off areas, especially as they are bright, draw attention away from the players', '2009-03-30 23:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409233, 776258, 96881, '<td valign="top">A very centred composition, and the surroundings don''t then add to it.  A large hole being evident, or some equipment, or something other than just the sign and some weeds would have helped this</td>', 'A very centred composition, and the surroundings don''t then add to it.  A large hole being evident, or some equipment, or something other than just the sign and some weeds would have helped this', '2009-03-30 23:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
