(5411953, 776247, 84438, '<td valign="top">I''d also like to highlight a comment by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=105164" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">linustgl</a> which read: <br/>"<i>overall I like this picture. the on thing that bothers me is the use of a child''s hand. Probably not old enough to read a book like this.</i>"<br/> <br/>You are absolutely 100% correct, and what an astute observation.  It is my son''s hand, and he is not quite 3 years old..  He has JUST started to understand the concept of reading.  And considering this is an autobiography of Louis Braille, he certainly is too young for it.</td>', 'I''d also like to highlight a comment by  linustgl which read: "overall I like this picture. the on thing that bothers me is the use of a child''s hand. Probably not old enough to read a book like this." You are absolutely 100% correct, and what an astute observation.  It is my son''s hand, and he is not quite 3 years old..  He has JUST started to understand the concept of reading.  And considering this is an autobiography of Louis Braille, he certainly is too young for it.', '2009-04-01 10:14:18.000000', NULL, 0),
