(5412127, 775894, 55621, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your finish, I guess I received a last minute surge because I thought you were ahead of me in the voting the day before.  Your photo was one of simplicity but conveyed language to the finest.  I''d be happy to give you the ribbon but since this is my first since joining I think I''d like to keep this one.  Thanks for a great challenge...<br/></td>', 'Congratulations on your finish, I guess I received a last minute surge because I thought you were ahead of me in the voting the day before.  Your photo was one of simplicity but conveyed language to the finest.  I''d be happy to give you the ribbon but since this is my first since joining I think I''d like to keep this one.  Thanks for a great challenge...', '2009-04-01 11:31:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5412133, 775598, 15832, '<td valign="top">Congrats... superb and out of the box idea...</td>', 'Congrats... superb and out of the box idea...', '2009-04-01 11:34:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5412202, 776247, 55621, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your second place finish.  Your entry was my pick for blue.  This was a tough challenge to convey language, the use of your son''s hand emphasizes the importance of teaching our children about language even at an early age.  Braille is such an important language and is prevalent every where we look, unfortunately most people over look it''s existence.  Stevie Wonder used to leave his braille magazines on airplanes in hopes of capturing someone''s attention.  He even joked about leaving his Playboy magazines.  Now there''s a thought provoking idea.</td>', 'Congratulations on your second place finish.  Your entry was my pick for blue.  This was a tough challenge to convey language, the use of your son''s hand emphasizes the importance of teaching our children about language even at an early age.  Braille is such an important language and is prevalent every where we look, unfortunately most people over look it''s existence.  Stevie Wonder used to leave his braille magazines on airplanes in hopes of capturing someone''s attention.  He even joked about leaving his Playboy magazines.  Now there''s a thought provoking idea.', '2009-04-01 11:52:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5412225, 775598, 55621, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first place finish.  I can''t understand how someone could give you 1''s or 2''s since this language is evident in every aspect of our lives, only if you are living in the 21st century.  Excellent finish...</td>', 'Congratulations on your first place finish.  I can''t understand how someone could give you 1''s or 2''s since this language is evident in every aspect of our lives, only if you are living in the 21st century.  Excellent finish...', '2009-04-01 11:59:56.000000', NULL, 0),
