(5414880, 775598, 19311, '<td valign="top">Excellent execution of the concept.  To be honest though, I''m a bit disapointed to see a water drop shot at the top of a language competition.  After all, why would water of all things be included in a shot with an ethernet cable.  I know its cool but other than that it really doesn''t make much sense. Not the first time I''ve felt like that.  We''ve all got our water shots on this site, at least yours is way better than most.  Congrats on the ribbon</td>', 'Excellent execution of the concept.  To be honest though, I''m a bit disapointed to see a water drop shot at the top of a language competition.  After all, why would water of all things be included in a shot with an ethernet cable.  I know its cool but other than that it really doesn''t make much sense. Not the first time I''ve felt like that.  We''ve all got our water shots on this site, at least yours is way better than most.  Congrats on the ribbon', '2009-04-02 11:56:06.000000', NULL, 0),
